From: Shammah Chancellor <shammah.chancellor@notvalid.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 10:16:15 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Add bounded inherited version codec and socket-free V2
 session

Preserve optional version suffixes, sentinel nonce checks and bounded unknown tails. Keep local service promises zero, inject monotonic deadlines, and gate application dispatch on complete V2 identity negotiation with immediate coalesced-frame capacity transition.
